<title>MOROCCO: Morocco to tender for 20,000T wheat for November.</title>
<headline>Morocco to tender for 20,000T wheat for November.</headline>
<dateline>CASABLANCA 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco will tender for 20,000 tonnes optional soft wheat on October 31, a spokesman for the Casablanca-based Moroccan Millers Association said.</p>
<p>&quot;We planned to launch a tender for October 28, 1996 but it has been postponed...It will finally take place on October 31,&quot; the spokesman said.</p>
<p>The quantity would be delivered between November 20 and 30, he added.</p>
<p>- Rabat newsroom (212-7) 726518</p>
